            <ArticleTitle>Introducing ward-based epidural pain relief.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1178-81</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Epidural pain relief has advantages for postoperative patients and can be provided safely in surgical wards. Changing practice from providing epidural analgesia in high-dependency areas only to ensuring its safe provision in the wards requires a team approach.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
